{"ID":"20240118145020-ektrflh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145020-ektrflh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145020-ektrflh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122160420-hnbzbvo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122160519-po533eb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:607\u0026#125;","title":"307石长生308陆英309盖草310牛扁","type":"doc","updated":"20240204112036"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240122160420-hnbzbvo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160420-hnbzbvo","updated":"20240122160422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"石长生"}]},{"ID":"20240118145020-wmy543j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145020-wmy543j","updated":"20240122160325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名丹草。味咸，微寒，有毒。治寒热，恶疮，大热，辟鬼气不祥。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160328-oei8335","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160328-oei8335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陕西，各处亦多有之，生于高山峻崖之上，四时不凋，固号长生。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160330-088p14a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160330-088p14a"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味咸，性微寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160331-at2rxbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160331-at2rxbg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】石长生主积聚痈肿，豁痰利尿，功能散结凝排脓，治胸膈满闷，咳嗽喘满。为解毒杀虫要药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160333-g4odk08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160333-g4odk08"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】下三虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160335-zymz21h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160335-zymz21h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治疥癣，逐诸风，治百邪魁。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160336-cv642ov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160336-cv642ov"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至钱半。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160337-lrvwo2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160337-lrvwo2h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】不详。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160326-a5aok0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160326-a5aok0n"}},{"ID":"20240122160338-9iqdd3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160338-9iqdd3v","updated":"20240204112022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三O七呢，我们称为石长生，石长生这个药现代人用得不多，诸位看它的味是咸味的，只要是咸味的药，都有攻坚的效果，所以有硬块、有痰，喉咙里面有痰阻，有个硬块长在里边，身上的……"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中医过去为认为说，很多的病啊，就是陈年的病啊，不是瘀血就是老痰，堵在里面，痰块，硬硬的，这个时候我们用攻坚咸味的药能够把它散化出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，哦，所以你看它的功能主治呢，石长生主积聚痈肿，能够袪痰利尿，能够散结排脓，都可以使用。石长生，现代一般人用得也不多。原因就是因为这个西医很盛行，就好象那个毒蛇咬到了，然后我们用蚤休煮汤在等的时候，他就把病人送到西医那边去了，那救护车或消防队他是不会送中医，他是直接送西医那里去，对不对，所以经验不多。"}]},{"ID":"20240122160338-3cestt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160338-3cestt3"}},{"ID":"20240122160424-2e3wbkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160424-2e3wbkc","updated":"20240122160430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"陆英"}]},{"ID":"20240122160430-hxaewwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160430-hxaewwy","updated":"20240122160435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，无毒。治骨间诸痹，四肢拘挛、疼酸，膝寒痛，阴痿，短气不足，脚肿。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160436-ecoidp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160436-ecoidp1"}},{"ID":"20240122160437-9po9z4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160437-9po9z4r","updated":"20240122160441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"盖草"}]},{"ID":"20240122160437-qy3esim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160437-qy3esim","updated":"20240122160449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治久咳上气，喘逆，久寒，惊悸，痂疥，白秃，疡气，杀皮肤小虫。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160457-tdg6h2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160457-tdg6h2y"}},{"ID":"20240122160455-ek0d77z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160455-ek0d77z","updated":"20240122160458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牛扁"}]},{"ID":"20240122160459-s9vpenw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160459-s9vpenw","updated":"20240122160503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，微寒，无毒。治身皮疮热气，可作浴汤，杀牛虱、小虫、又治牛病。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160503-aalfndh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160503-aalfndh"}},{"ID":"20240122160504-r0ioc8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160504-r0ioc8w"}},{"ID":"20240122160504-0nrfiaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160504-0nrfiaa","updated":"20240204112036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三O八、三O九、三一O，陆英，还有这些啊，这个到牛扁，这三味药呢也是没有人认得了也没有人使用它。"}]},{"ID":"20240122160519-po533eb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160519-po533eb"}}]}